OL,3,GNEWSAEx-boxing chief looks back on life
OL,4,Aat age of 90
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Being the son of a rag-and-bone man, I
OL,7,Fhad to pinch myself being among all
OL,8,Fthese superstars," says 90-year-old
OL,9,FFred Little, who enjoyed a remarkable
OL,10,Fcareer overseeing some of the biggest
OL,11,Fnights in professional boxing.
OL,13,FAs well as being brought into contact
OL,14,Fwith the likes of Tyson Fury, Frank
OL,15,FBruno and Ricky Hatton, Fred,
OL,16,Foriginally from Barton Hill, Bristol,
OL,17,Falso worked in security for big stars
OL,18,Fsuch as Tom Jones.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
