OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1793294763
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAEx-boxing chief looks back on life
OL,4,Aat age of 90
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs a boxing inspector, overseeing
OL,7,Fsafety, regulations and medical
OL,8,Fstandards, one of his standout memories
OL,9,Fcame in Las Vegas, where he watched Roy
OL,10,FJones Jr take on Antonio Tarver in an
OL,11,Fatmosphere he described as
OL,12,F"unbelievable".
OL,14,FNow, as he celebrates his 90th
OL,15,Fbirthday, Fred is reflecting on a
OL,16,Fremarkable life that has taken him from
OL,17,Fwartime Bristol to top-flight boxing.
